    "from the prototype's own curated catalogs (gui/prototype/data/nerd-fonts-catalog.json",
    "and cjk-catalog.json — design content, keyed there by the same family",
    "ids our manifest uses; the five CJK ids that differ are mapped in the",
    "generator). License and variant stay sourced from assets/fonts.manifest.json",
    "via gui/src/data/catalog.json; this file only overlays what the manifest",
    "cannot know. Prototype families absent from our manifest (得意黑, 更纱黑体,",
    "方舟像素, 缝合像素, 朱雀仿宋) are honest misses and stay out."
